    "name": "Code Chivalric",
    "review_state": "approved",
    "reviewed_at": "2026-09-15T04:35:16Z",
    "reviewed_by": "claude-sonnet-5-reviewer",
    "summary": "IMPERIAL KNIGHTS army: at end of Read Mission Objectives, pick or roll D6 for a Deed and a Quality. Deeds: 1-2 pick an enemy CHARACTER at battle start, completed at end of a turn if destroyed; 3-4 at end of opponent's turn if you control more objective markers; 5-6 at end of battle round if enemy units destroyed that round > round number. Quality lasts until battle end for models with this ability: 1-2 when it shoots or fights, re-roll one Hit and one Wound roll; 3-4 +2\" Move, +1 Advance/Charge; 5-6 +2 OC, +1 Ld. First completion: Honoured; 2CP (3CP if either rolled), ignoring the 1CP/round cap."
  }
